    37→            // There's a race condition where a call starts when the app has been killed and the
    38→            // observation set in `incomingCallID` occurs *before* the user session is restored.
    39→            // So observe when the client proxy is set to fix this (the method guards for the call).
    40→            Task { await observeIncomingCall() }
